{"id":"atout","lemma":"atout","pos":"noun","rank":4003,"glosses":["trump","advantage, asset"],"ipa":"/a.tu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/Fr-atout.ogg/Fr-atout.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"atouts"},"formAudio":{"atouts":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-atouts.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La simplicité est un atout.","en":"Simplicity is the key.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"simplicity"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"C'est le moment pour toi de jouer ton atout.","en":"The time has come for you to play your trump card.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"moment"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"J'ai toujours un atout dans ma manche.","en":"I always have an ace up my sleeve.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"sleeve"}]},{"text":"J'ai un autre atout dans la manche.","en":"I have another ace up my sleeve.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,null,null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"sleeve"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"another, a different"]]},{"text":"Une personne qui ne veut pas lire n'a pas d'atout par rapport à une autre qui ne peut pas.","en":"A person who won't read has no advantage over one who can't read.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to read"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"other"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"}],"phrases":[[12,15,"in relation to"]]}]}